          "source": "docs/server-cores/01-vanilla.md"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key_path": "use-native-transport",
      "chinese_entries": [
        {
          "term": "原生网络（Linux）",
          "context": "Linux 上启用 epoll 原生网络 IO，性能更高。非 Linux 自动忽略。",
          "source": "docs/server-cores/01-vanilla.md"
        }
